    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Manon rose to become manbo (priestess) of the Haitian voodoo cult devoted to Ezuli, a Setite worshipped by her followers as the loa of love and sex. Ezuli's own sire, the vengeful Ghede, had watched the cult for nearly two centuries plotting revenge against his renegade childe; when he discovered Manon, his fascination with her overtook his plans. Ezuli caught Ghede approaching her priestess and confronted him, and in a jealous rage Ghede nearly drained Manon to death before Ezuli slipped her own blood between the dying woman's lips, ensuring a rival claim on the new vampire. Rather than lose Manon to Ezuli outright, Ghede spirited her away to New Orleans aboard the first available ship. Manon has since built her own following in the city and is now recognized as one of the most powerful Setites in the southeastern United States, reveling in the corruption she once merely served, even as Ghede continues to nurse both his obsession with her and his hope of using her to wound Ezuli.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Coldly determined; you take a quiet, growing pleasure in the discomfort mortals feel around you, channeling what was once your passion for love into a passion for corruption instead.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Animalism 2, Auspex 3, Dominate 2, Obfuscate 3, Presence 3, Serpentis 4.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Ezuli. Both Ezuli and Ezuli's own vengeful sire Ghede have unfinished business with Manon and may intervene in her affairs. Haven: a warehouse by the docks. Secrets rating: A-.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
